HISTORY ii130109r_08101045936_raw.fits                                          HISTORY ii131a09r_08074155957_raw.fits                                          COMMENT = 'Reference file created by J. Mack'                                   HISTORY   flat125wi_pfl.fits renamed to sca20262i_pfl.fits on Dec 10 2008       HISTORY   November 19, 2010: This new IR flatfield is a combination of the      HISTORY   existing ground-based flatfield and a new low-frequency correction    HISTORY    (L-flat) derived from a large number (>2000) of long exposure (>300s)HISTORY   science images that have been combined after masking out objects,     HISTORY   effectively equating the L-flat with a high S/N sky image. A modest   HISTORY   smoothing has been applied to the L-flat. The L-flat does not show a  HISTORY   significant wave-length dependence, therefore a single L-flat has beenHISTORY   applied to all filters.                                               HISTORY   The sky image was created using calwf3 version 2.1 (15-May-2010).     HISTORY   flat_f125w_pfl.fits renamed to uc72113qi_pfl.fits on Dec 7 2010       HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY   ----------------                                                      HISTORY   October 01, 2020: These new P-flats were computed by stacking deep    HISTORY   exposures of sparse fields (with sources masked) over the WFC3        HISTORY   lifetime. They replace the prior set of reference files, which were   HISTORY   based on the original ground flats, multiplied by a 'grey' sky flat   HISTORY   correction from inflight data through 2010. The new sky flats correct HISTORY   for wavelength-dependent residuals of +/-0.5% at the center of the    HISTORY   detector and 1-2% at the detector edges, with Poisson errors ~0.2% or HISTORY   better. For details, see Mack et al. 2020, WFC3 ISR in prep., "WFC3/IRHISTORY   Filter-Dependent Sky Flats".                                          HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY   An accompanying set of 'delta' D-flats corrects for 148 known IR      HISTORY   'blobs' in six filters as a function of date. These were computed by  HISTORY   stacking the sky flat observations after the appearance of each blob  HISTORY   and correct for losses as large as ~30% at the blob center with <1%   HISTORY   errors. For details, see Olszewski et al. 2020, WFC3 ISR in prep.,    HISTORY   "WFC3/IR Blob Flats".                                                 HISTORY   ---------------                                                       HISTORY F125W_new_pfl.fits renamed to 4ac1921ii_pfl.fits on Oct 12 2020                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         